{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794865366597,"sessionID":"ses_e19b0e5bfffekS89YIWXLEKMH9","part":{"partID":"prt_1e64ffc4f001MIUKisSmvKgqkR","sessionID":"ses_e19b0e5bfffekS89YIWXLEKMH9","messageID":"msg_1e64feb28001LjGfQPVhc4424e","type":"tool","id":"call_e7507e9ec2ea4b35aeddc82b","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"step_create_state_log\\|step_reduce_state\\|phase_init\\|phase_main_loop\\|phase_synthesis\\|step_fanout\\|step_check_convergence\\|step_graph\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -60","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"102:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n304:  step_fanout_spawn:\n305:    description: \"Spawn fan-out lineages; skip and proceed to phase_init normally when single-executor\"\n311:      This step runs before phase_init, so pass the raw review_focus. fanout-run.cjs\n323:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n324:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n325:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n327:      step_fanout_spawn_cli:\n349:  phase_init:\n556:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n587:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n720:      step_create_state_log:\n954:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n978:      step_graph_convergence:\n990:        note: \"The script is the only place the stop decision is computed. step_check_convergence branches on its stop_decision output.\"\n1017:      step_check_convergence:\n1018:        action: \"Branch on the stop decision that convergence.cjs computed in step_graph_convergence\"\n1065:          If stop_decision is missing from the step_graph_convergence output, do not decide by hand: halt and report the script output.\n1097:          - graph_decision: \"CONTINUE | STOP_ALLOWED | STOP_BLOCKED from step_graph_convergence\"\n1138:            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1257:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1301:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1304:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1308:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1312:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1415:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1545:            - \"cli-opencode self-invocation guard: this single-executor branch must only run from a non-OpenCode dispatch surface (Claude Code/raw shell). Explicit parallel-detached cli-opencode fan-out is handled by step_fanout_spawn_cli/fanout-run.cjs, not this branch. the `cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode` mode's SKILL.md (`.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/SKILL.md`) §SELF-INVOCATION PROHIBITED contract is the authoritative gate\"\n1714:          action: \"Mark the iteration as invalid for convergence. The next iteration's claimAdjudicationGate (step_check_convergence step 0) reads the persisted `passed: false` event and vetoes STOP until a follow-up iteration rewrites the packets.\"\n1728:          log: \"Claim adjudication incomplete for new P0/P1 findings. Event persisted. The next iteration's step_check_convergence claim-adjudication pre-check will veto STOP while `passed: false` remains the latest event and active P0/P1 > 0.\"\n1750:      step_graph_upsert:\n1800:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1816:  phase_synthesis:\n1820:      step_fanout_merge:\n1850:          - p0_count: \"When step_fanout_merge bound it, keep the merged value; the fan-out verdict reads it. Otherwise the count of open findings in {state_paths.findings_registry} with status active and severity P0, for the pre-synthesis display only.\"\n1853:          - failed_required_gate_ids: \"When step_fanout_merge bound it, keep the merged value. Otherwise take failedRequiredGateIds from the last line of {state_paths.state_log} with type === 'event' and event === 'terminal_gates', else []. Read the state log, not the registry: the reducer last ran before the stop wrote that row.\"\n2277:  consecutive_failures: \"See step_check_convergence rule 1a. The script counts trailing failed iterations from the state log and returns stop reason error.\"\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"102:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n304:  step_fanout_spawn:\n305:    description: \"Spawn fan-out lineages; skip and proceed to phase_init normally when single-executor\"\n311:      This step runs before phase_init, so pass the raw review_focus. fanout-run.cjs\n323:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n324:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n325:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n327:      step_fanout_spawn_cli:\n349:  phase_init:\n556:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n587:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n720:      step_create_state_log:\n954:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n978:      step_graph_convergence:\n990:        note: \"The script is the only place the stop decision is computed. step_check_convergence branches on its stop_decision output.\"\n1017:      step_check_convergence:\n1018:        action: \"Branch on the stop decision that convergence.cjs computed in step_graph_convergence\"\n1065:          If stop_decision is missing from the step_graph_convergence output, do not decide by hand: halt and report the script output.\n1097:          - graph_decision: \"CONTINUE | STOP_ALLOWED | STOP_BLOCKED from step_graph_convergence\"\n1138:            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1257:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1301:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1304:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1308:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1312:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1415:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1545:            - \"cli-opencode self-invocation guard: this single-executor branch must only run from a non-OpenCode dispatch surface (Claude Code/raw shell). Explicit parallel-detached cli-opencode fan-out is handled by step_fanout_spawn_cli/fanout-run.cjs, not this branch. the `cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode` mode's SKILL.md (`.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/SKILL.md`) §SELF-INVOCATION PROHIBITED contract is the authoritative gate\"\n1714:          action: \"Mark the iteration as invalid for convergence. The next iteration's claimAdjudicationGate (step_check_convergence step 0) reads the persisted `passed: false` event and vetoes STOP until a follow-up iteration rewrites the packets.\"\n1728:          log: \"Claim adjudication incomplete for new P0/P1 findings. Event persisted. The next iteration's step_check_convergence claim-adjudication pre-check will veto STOP while `passed: false` remains the latest event and active P0/P1 > 0.\"\n1750:      step_graph_upsert:\n1800:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1816:  phase_synthesis:\n1820:      step_fanout_merge:\n1850:          - p0_count: \"When step_fanout_merge bound it, keep the merged value; the fan-out verdict reads it. Otherwise the count of open findings in {state_paths.findings_registry} with status active and severity P0, for the pre-synthesis display only.\"\n1853:          - failed_required_gate_ids: \"When step_fanout_merge bound it, keep the merged value. Otherwise take failedRequiredGateIds from the last line of {state_paths.state_log} with type === 'event' and event === 'terminal_gates', else []. Read the state log, not the registry: the reducer last ran before the stop wrote that row.\"\n2277:  consecutive_failures: \"See step_check_convergence rule 1a. The script counts trailing failed iterations from the state log and returns stop reason error.\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"grep -n \\\"step_create_state_log\\\\|step_reduce_state\\\\|phase_init\\\\|phase_main_loop\\\\|phase_synthesis\\\\|step_fanout\\\\|step_check_convergence\\\\|step_graph\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -60\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794865364047,"end":1794865366597}}}}
