{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794865770748,"sessionID":"ses_e19b0e5bfffekS89YIWXLEKMH9","part":{"partID":"prt_1e65600820017qcjXGbq2FxAx0","sessionID":"ses_e19b0e5bfffekS89YIWXLEKMH9","messageID":"msg_1e655f33e001sG6mKY2uOx5vvJ","type":"tool","id":"call_504f61ee8ae84988be5aa34a","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - advisor intent signals, playbook prompt and ADR pass thirteen\ndescription: Runtime strategy for the data-13 lineage, tracking the seven new advisor intent_signals phrases, the CL-009 playbook prompt change and ADR-001's stale-graph waiver.\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: planning\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - data-13\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent state for the `data-13` lineage of review pass thirteen. It records which dimensions remain, what was found, which approaches worked, and where the next iteration focuses.\n\n### Usage\n\n- **Init:** populated from the review brief, the scope file and the commit range.\n- **Per iteration:** read Next Focus, review the named area, record findings, mark dimensions, set the next focus.\n- **Mutability:** updated in place by this lineage.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview of the data area for command surfacing pass thirteen. The area covers seven new phrases appended to `system-skill-advisor`'s `intent_signals` in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/graph-metadata.json` (skill graph is stale, rebuild the skill graph, vibe prompt hook, advisor briefs, behaviour arena, clean arena, routing arm), the CL-009 manual-testing playbook prompt change in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/brief-command-policy-word.md`, and ADR-001 in `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/040-final-alignment-loop/decision-record.md`, which waives AC-004 for probe P05 and keeps the stale-graph prompt on `/doctor:helper`. The diff runs `b8ebee37d75..932aff4e437`.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] D1 Correctness\n- [ ] D2 Security\n- [ ] D3 Traceability\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Reviewing the mention area (`command-attach.ts`, its guard tests) assigned to `mention-13`; read-only context only.\n- Re-reporting the recorded limits in `review-brief-13.txt` unless a new input breaks them.\n- Re-reporting the open P2 list of `038-alignment-p1-remediation/scratch/alignment-final-dispositions.md` and of review passes ten to twelve.\n- Running the repository suite, the build, or any git write; this lineage reports only.\n- Opening `command-prompts.jsonl`, `holdout-prompts.jsonl` or `behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl` except through the allowed aggregate path; the holdout rule stays in force.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Composite convergence stop at threshold 0.10 with all four dimensions covered.\n- `maxIterations` 8 reached without a legal convergence stop.\n- A blocking stop from `convergence.cjs` naming an uncovered dimension or an unresolved active P0.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- Init: reading the scope file, the three diffs, then the whole files at `932aff4e437` before choosing a focus. It separated the phrase delta (seven signals), the doc delta (one prompt) and the ADR delta (one row).\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- Init: none.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[None yet]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[None yet]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\nDimension: correctness. Read the new intent signals and the scorer lane that consumes them, then test ordinary prompts that carry those phrases. Check the playbook prompt against its expected lines and ADR-001 against probe P05. Required evidence: a before/after score comparison and the rendered policy label.\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/graph-metadata.json` (intent_signals 33-39), `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/brief-command-policy-word.md` (commands 4-5 and Expected), `040-final-alignment-loop/decision-record.md` (ADR-001 row), `040-final-alignment-loop/acceptance-criteria.md` (AC-004), `040-final-alignment-loop/tasks.md` (T006), `040-final-alignment-loop/scratch/probes.json`.\n- Claimed behavior: the four probe prompts P07/P08/P09 top `system-skill-advisor`; P05 stays on `/doctor:helper` under ADR-001; the CL-009 prompt renders `system-skilled-doctor → /doctor:update (ask)` in a parent and `(parent-named only)` in a child.\n- Reuse and convention pointers: the explicit author lane reads `intent_signals` as exact declared phrases; the graph lane reads the compiled `runtime/scripts/skill-graph.json` signals; `declared-phrase-specificity.vitest.ts` states the specificity contract.\n- Risk areas: generic two-word phrases matching ordinary prompts; the waived P05 remaining reachable by the advisor once graph-freshness phrases exist; stale `derived` block beside fresh `intent_signals`.\n- Out of scope: the mention area, holdout corpora, and any source edit.\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/data-13/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/data-13/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/data-13/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"---\\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - advisor intent signals, playbook prompt and ADR pass thirteen\\ndescription: Runtime strategy for the data-13 lineage, tracking the seven new advisor intent_signals phrases, the CL-009 playbook prompt change and ADR-001's stale-graph waiver.\\nimportance_tier: normal\\ncontextType: planning\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Review Strategy - data-13\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent state for the `data-13` lineage of review pass thirteen. It records which dimensions remain, what was found, which approaches worked, and where the next iteration focuses.\\n\\n### Usage\\n\\n- **Init:** populated from the review brief, the scope file and the commit range.\\n- **Per iteration:** read Next Focus, review the named area, record findings, mark dimensions, set the next focus.\\n- **Mutability:** updated in place by this lineage.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview of the data area for command surfacing pass thirteen. The area covers seven new phrases appended to `system-skill-advisor`'s `intent_signals` in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/graph-metadata.json` (skill graph is stale, rebuild the skill graph, vibe prompt hook, advisor briefs, behaviour arena, clean arena, routing arm), the CL-009 manual-testing playbook prompt change in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/brief-command-policy-word.md`, and ADR-001 in `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/040-final-alignment-loop/decision-record.md`, which waives AC-004 for probe P05 and keeps the stale-graph prompt on `/doctor:helper`. The diff runs `b8ebee37d75..932aff4e437`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness\\n- [ ] D2 Security\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Reviewing the mention area (`command-attach.ts`, its guard tests) assigned to `mention-13`; read-only context only.\\n- Re-reporting the recorded limits in `review-brief-13.txt` unless a new input breaks them.\\n- Re-reporting the open P2 list of `038-alignment-p1-remediation/scratch/alignment-final-dispositions.md` and of review passes ten to twelve.\\n- Running the repository suite, the build, or any git write; this lineage reports only.\\n- Opening `command-prompts.jsonl`, `holdout-prompts.jsonl` or `behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl` except through the allowed aggregate path; the holdout rule stays in force.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Composite convergence stop at threshold 0.10 with all four dimensions covered.\\n- `maxIterations` 8 reached without a legal convergence stop.\\n- A blocking stop from `convergence.cjs` naming an uncovered dimension or an unresolved active P0.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n- Init: reading the scope file, the three diffs, then the whole files at `932aff4e437` before choosing a focus. It separated the phrase delta (seven signals), the doc delta (one prompt) and the ADR delta (one row).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- Init: none.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n[None yet]\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[None yet]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\nDimension: correctness. Read the new intent signals and the scorer lane that consumes them, then test ordinary prompts that carry those phrases. Check the playbook prompt against its expected lines and ADR-001 against probe P05. Required evidence: a before/after score comparison and the rendered policy label.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/graph-metadata.json` (intent_signals 33-39), `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/brief-command-policy-word.md` (commands 4-5 and Expected), `040-final-alignment-loop/decision-record.md` (ADR-001 row), `040-final-alignment-loop/acceptance-criteria.md` (AC-004), `040-final-alignment-loop/tasks.md` (T006), `040-final-alignment-loop/scratch/probes.json`.\\n- Claimed behavior: the four probe prompts P07/P08/P09 top `system-skill-advisor`; P05 stays on `/doctor:helper` under ADR-001; the CL-009 prompt renders `system-skilled-doctor → /doctor:update (ask)` in a parent and `(parent-named only)` in a child.\\n- Reuse and convention pointers: the explicit author lane reads `intent_signals` as exact declared phrases; the graph lane reads the compiled `runtime/scripts/skill-graph.json` signals; `declared-phrase-specificity.vitest.ts` states the specificity contract.\\n- Risk areas: generic two-word phrases matching ordinary prompts; the waived P05 remaining reachable by the advisor once graph-freshness phrases exist; stale `derived` block beside fresh `intent_signals`.\\n- Out of scope: the mention area, holdout corpora, and any source edit.\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/data-13/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794865758338,"end":1794865770748}}}}
