sor:0.82 first and sk-design:0.82 second; the stripped projection returned only sk-design. explicit_author 0.88 evidence author:clean arena.\", disposition: \"active\", findingClass: \"algorithmic\", scopeProof: \"Exact A/B above with the built scorer; the explicit lane matched the declared phrase inside the longer noun phrase.\", affectedSurfaceHints: [\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/graph-metadata.json\", \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts\", \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/scorer/declared-phrase-specificity.vitest.ts\"], recommendation: \"Require a phrase boundary after a declared signal, or add the ordinary noun-phrase sense as a negative fixture.\" }\n];\nconst nodes = [\n { type: \"node\", id: \"d-correctness\", kind: \"DIMENSION\", label: \"correctness\" },\n { type: \"node\", id: \"d-traceability\", kind: \"DIMENSION\", label: \"traceability\" }\n];\nconst slug = (p) => p.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]+/g, \"-\").replace(/^-|-$/g, \"\").slice(0, 60);\nconst seen = new Set();\nfor (const f of files) {\n  const path = f.split(\":\")[0];\n  const id = \"file-\" + slug(path);\n  if (seen.has(id)) continue;\n  seen.add(id);\n  nodes.push({ type: \"node\", id, kind: \"FILE\", label: path });\n}\nfor (const f of findings) nodes.push({ type: \"node\", id: \"f-\" + f.id, kind: \"FINDING\", label: f.title });\nnodes.push({ type: \"node\", id: \"ev-F001\", kind: \"EVIDENCE\", label: \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/graph-metadata.json:101-107\" });\nnodes.push({ type: \"node\", id: \"ev-F002\", kind: \"EVIDENCE\", label: \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/graph-metadata.json:106\" });\nconst edges = [];\nlet ec = 0;\nfor (const f of files) {\n  const path = f.split(\":\")[0];\n  const id = \"file-\" + slug(path);\n  if (!seen.has(\"cover-\" + id + \"-correctness\")) {\n    seen.add(\"cover-\" + id + \"-correctness\");\n    edges.push({ type: \"edge\", id: \"e-cov-c-\" + (++ec), source: \"d-correctness\", target: id, relation: \"COVERS\" });\n  }\n  if (!seen.has(\"cover-\" + id + \"-traceability\")) {\n    seen.add(\"cover-\" + id + \"-traceability\");\n    edges.push({ type: \"edge\", id: \"e-cov-t-\" + (++ec), source: \"d-traceability\", target: id, relation: \"COVERS\" });\n  }\n}\nfor (const f of findings) {\n  const path = f.file.split(\":\")[0];\n  edges.push({ type: \"edge\", id: \"e-in-dim-\" + f.id, source: \"f-\" + f.id, target: \"d-correctness\", relation: \"IN_DIMENSION\" });\n  edges.push({ type: \"edge\", id: \"e-in-file-\" + f.id, source: \"f-\" + f.id, target: \"file-\" + slug(path), relation: \"IN_FILE\" });\n  edges.push({ type: \"edge\", id: \"e-ev-\" + f.id, source: \"ev-\" + f.id, target: \"f-\" + f.id, relation: \"EVIDENCE_FOR\" });\n}\nconst record = {\n  type: \"iteration\",\n  iteration: 1,\n  run: 1,\n  mode: \"review\",\n  target_agent: \"deep-review\",\n  agent_definition_loaded: true,\n  resolved_route: \"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\n  status: \"complete\",\n  focus: \"correctness and traceability - seven new intent_signals phrases, CL-009 prompt and ADR-001\",\n  dimensions: [\"correctness\", \"traceability\"],\n  filesReviewed: files,\n  findingsCount: findings.length,\n  findingsSummary: { P0: 0, P1: 1, P2: 1 },\n  findingsNew: { P0: 0, P1: 1, P2: 1 },\n  findingDetails: findings,\n  traceabilityChecks: { results: [\n    { protocolId: \"spec_code\", status: \"pass\", gateClass: \"hard\", applicable: true, evidence: [\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/graph-metadata.json:101-107\", \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill-graph.json\"], summary: \"Seven signals appended as T006 says, and the compiled graph carries the same seven strings.\" },\n    { protocolId: \"checklist_evidence\", status: \"pass\", gateClass: \"hard\", applicable: true, evidence: [\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/040-final-alignment-loop/acceptance-criteria.md:59\",