{"type":"text","timestamp":1794866720085,"sessionID":"ses_e19b0e5bfffekS89YIWXLEKMH9","part":{"id":"prt_1e6649c4a0025F4v6drGC30Cer","sessionID":"ses_e19b0e5bfffekS89YIWXLEKMH9","messageID":"msg_1e6648378001Svbg60CbNXtGQS","type":"text","text":"Lineage complete. Summary:\n\n**data-13 — 3 iterations, converged (`STOP`, score 1.0, blockedBy `[]`), verdict CONDITIONAL**\n\nFindings:\n- **F001 (P1)** `graph-metadata.json:101` — five of the seven new `intent_signals` leak ordinary words (`clean`, `arena`, `arm`, `advisor`, `briefs`) into the lexical lane. Four ordinary prompts now top `system-skill-advisor` at 0.82 with `passes_threshold: true` and return no skill with the signals stripped; `fix the routing arm in the nginx config` displaces `sk-code`.\n- **F002 (P2)** `graph-metadata.json:106` — `clean arena` matches inside `clean arena seating …`, ranking the advisor above `sk-design` for a design request.\n- **F003 (P2)** `declared-phrase-specificity.vitest.ts:169` — the two shipped scorers disagree on the new phrases (`the arena is clean now`: native advisor 0.82, Python fallback none), and the cross-scorer contract pins only two phrases.\n\nConfirmed clean: ADR-001 holds (P05 stays `command-doctor-helper` at 0.8, before and after), the CL-009 `check for skilled updates` prompt renders `system-skilled-advisor → /doctor:update (ask)` / `(parent-named only)` exactly as expected, the compiled graph carries all seven signals, and holdout hygiene is intact (bridge generator reads no corpus; `measure-brief-cost.mjs` refuses holdout rows).\n\nArtifacts written inside `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/data-13`: 3 iteration files, 3 deltas (first line equals its record), gateway-written state log with 3 iteration records + 3 convergence events + synthesis event, reducer-owned registry (0/1/2) and dashboard, strategy, and `review-report.md`. One ledger note is recorded: the synthesis event was committed before the iteration-3 convergence row; content is correct, only commit order differs.\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:data-13","time":{"start":1794866715722,"end":1794866720085}}}
